  "prefLabel": "He-P 4034.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4034.01 Purpose. This part prescribes requirements for the issuance of licenses or registration for the industrial use of sources of radiation and radiation safety requirements for persons using these sources of radiation in industrial radiography.\n\nSource. #6942, eff 2-1-99; ss by #8800, INTERIM, eff 2-1-07, EXPIRED: 7-31-07\n\nNew. # 8959, eff 8-7-07; ss by #10983, eff 11-24-15; ss by #14325, eff 7-19-25, EXPIRES: 7-19-35",
